ons","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot Engine v4.7.beta1.official.1c8cc9e7e\n- Reproducible in Godot v4.6.1.stable.mono\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable.mono - Windows 10 (build 19044) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7683) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10750H CPU @ 2.60GHz (12 threads) - 19.79 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nYou can change these window properties while a window is in fullscreen, and it will change the window style.\nThis is the result of running the code below in MRP. As you can see, the window style has changed to something else.\n\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"333\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/53979c85-f010-44bf-b3c8-996652ae04b7\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```gdscript\nextends Control\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tget_window().mode = Window.MODE_FULLSCREEN\n\tget_window().maximize_disabled = true # Either this\n\tget_window().unresizable = true # or this can cause it, whether its true or false, it doesn't matter\n\tget_window().mode = Window.MODE_WINDOWED\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[godot-window-style-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27103443/godot-window-style-bug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118977/reactions","total_count"